1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,500
Most short-form clips lose attention because they start with setup instead of a sharp payoff.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:09,000
The fix is to lead with the strongest claim, then prove it with two clean supporting beats.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:13,500
Every beat should ask for a different visual, so the edit feels rebuilt instead of merely trimmed.

4
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:18,000
End by naming the practical takeaway, because the audience remembers structure more than slogans.
